messages.content:
Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: contrib/visupng/PngFile.c
Line: 202
Function: PngLoadImage
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: If the caller passes pBkgColor == NULL and the PNG file has a bKGD chunk (png_get_bKGD returns true), the code unconditionally writes to pBkgColor->red/green/blue (lines 202-204), dereferencing a NULL pointer and crashing.

Source context:
```c
